# apps/web needs React 19; apps/mobile (Expo/React Native) needs React 18.
# node-linker=hoisted at the root used to mix the two at the shared root
# node_modules (react-dom resolved to 19.x while react resolved to 18.x,
# which crashes the Next.js build with "Cannot read properties of null
# (reading 'useRef')"). Hoisting is still needed for Expo/Metro, so it is
# now scoped to apps/mobile/.npmrc instead of applying workspace-wide.
